# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — aligned with gitattributes (multi-language / multi-platform)
# =============================================================================
# Ignores build output, local tooling, secrets, and machine-specific files.
#
# Git LFS (see gitattributes): images, audio, video, 3D assets, fonts,
# documents, archives, and other binaries are tracked via LFS — their
# extensions are intentionally NOT listed here so LFS rules can apply.
# Build artifacts are ignored by directory/path instead.
# =============================================================================

